  "shared_key_variants": {
    "link.1be52ce4d6ee": "Reviewed Portuguese renders the 'Comprehensive list at ... Going Further · References' line as 'Lista abrangente em ... Ir Além' on 01b-react through 02c-deep and 'Lista completa em ... Próximos passos' on 03a-kickstart through 04a-safety, so the link text and the cited section name both differ.",
    "text.140bedbf9c3f": "Reviewed Portuguese localizes the reader-facing 01a-loop 'none' label as 'nenhuma' while three protocol/status occurrences remain 'none'.",
    "text.552e423045fc": "Reviewed Portuguese uses '(nenhum)' or '(nenhuma)' for reader-facing empty states while operational and compact trace occurrences retain '(none)'.",
    "text.588da4105320": "Reviewed Portuguese moves 'labirinto' into one 01a-loop separator value so the shared ternary keeps Portuguese word order; the other separator occurrences remain punctuation only.",
    "text.67a5bdf2a82d": "Reviewed Portuguese renders the 'NVIDIA · Securing Agents' brand line three ways: 'Proteção de Agentes' on 01a-loop and the course index, 'Segurança de Agentes' on 01b-react through 02c-deep, and 'Proteção de agentes' on the remaining six lessons. Term and capitalization are both a Portuguese terminology decision.",
    "text.680694f37af1": "Reviewed Portuguese preserves three previously shipped rendered-artifact hints across the lesson cells, including 'rode (Run)', 'execute', and 'execute novamente' forms.",
    "text.898702fa218d": "Reviewed Portuguese renders 'the Try-it artifact, in code' three ways: 'o artefato Experimente' on 01a-loop and 04b-modern-clis, 'o artefato de experimentação' on 02a-routing and 02b-rag, and the untranslated 'o artefato Try-it' on the three Module 3 pages.",
    "text.b2eef2ab0d7f": "Reviewed Portuguese spells out ' mensagens' on 01a-loop and retains the compact trace abbreviation ' msgs' on 02c-deep.",
    "text.bef9d85df8ea": "'Selected: ' appears twice in web/index.html. The reviewed Portuguese overlay translates the language-picker occurrence as 'Selecionado: ' and leaves the second picker's occurrence in English, so the page ships both.",
    "text.1f5087db919c": "Codex reviewed this distinction at the maintainer's request: 01b-react translates the learner-visible log label 'question' as 'pergunta'; 01c-tools and 02b-rag retain 'question' as an executable tool-schema field name."
  },
